      breach: { headline: "APAC incident response capabilities must meet India CERT-In 6-hour notification as the governing standard", excerpt: "Security leads at APAC organisations with India operations must implement incident response capabilities meeting India CERT-In's 6-hour notification requirement as the primary performance standard. This requires automated detection infrastructure, pre-built CERT-In notification templates, and tested portal access credentials. Manual incident response processes cannot achieve 6-hour notification compliance for large-scale Indian personal data incidents — automated detection is mandatory.", action: "Implement automated incident detection and CERT-In notification infrastructure meeting the 6-hour standard. Benchmark detection and escalation capabilities against the 6-hour clock. Manual processes are structurally inadequate for CERT-In compliance." },
