      litigation: { headline: "APAC privacy professionals — Australia Privacy Act reform creates immediate pre-litigation compliance priority", excerpt: "Privacy professionals at APAC organisations with Australian operations should treat the Australia Privacy Act reform as a pre-litigation compliance investment trigger. Legal practitioners have identified health data, loyalty programme profiling, and behavioral advertising as primary litigation targets. Compliance documentation quality for these three categories in Australian operations is the most effective pre-litigation risk mitigation available before the private right of action passes.", action: "Prioritise Australian compliance documentation quality for health data, loyalty programme, and behavioral advertising operations. These are the identified primary litigation targets — documentation quality is the most effective pre-litigation risk mitigation." },
